{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-82858:  python36:3.6 security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "python36\n[3.6.8-39]\n- Provide /usr/bin/python3 explicitly\n- Resolves: RHEL-2113\n\npython-distro\n[1.4.0-2]\n- Port from Fedora to RHEL8, part of the python36 module\n- Resolves: rhbz#1678920\n\npython-docs\n[3.6.7-2]\n- Bumping due to problems with modular RPM upgrade path\n- Resolves: rhbz#1695587\n\npython-docutils\n[0.14-12]\n- Bumping due to problems with modular RPM upgrade path\n- Resolves: rhbz#1695587\n\npython-nose\n[1.3.7-31]\n- Adjusted the postun scriptlets to enable upgrading to RHEL 9\n- Resolves: rhbz#1933055\n\npython-pygments\n[2.2.0-22]\n- Fix CVE-2021-27291: ReDos via crafted malicious input\nResolves: rhbz#1943459 rhbz#1943460\n\npython-pymongo\n[3.7.0-3]\n- Backport CVE-2026-88029\n\npython-PyMySQL\n[0.10.1-2]\n- Revert upstream change of default charset (from utf8mb4 to latin1)\n- Resolves BZ#1885641\n\npython-sqlalchemy\n[1.3.2-3]\n- Fix GROUP BY for joined relationships\nResolves: RHEL-17464\n\npython-virtualenv\n[15.1.0-23]\n- Security fix for CVE-2024-53899\nResolves: RHEL-68876\n\npython-wheel\n[1:0.31.1-3]\n- Adjusted the postun scriptlets to enable upgrading to RHEL 9\n- Resolves: rhbz#1933055\n\nscipy\n[1.0.0-21]\n- Do not create -PYTEST.pyc files\n- Resolves: rhbz#1934199",
